# Diagnostic form endpoint. Formspree or Web3Forms, per
# docs/revision-plan/02-architecture.md §7.
#
# The account must be owned by Modelly, not the agency, so the client keeps the
# submissions. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the real endpoint there.
# Never commit the real value.
#
# Without this variable the form renders an inline configuration error instead of
# submitting into nothing.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
